abstract:
An evaporation tray ( 1 ) for condensation water ( 4 ), in particular for a refrigerator, comprising 
     an electric heater ( 3 ) arranged inside the tray ( 1 ), so that it can be wetted by the water contained in the tray ( 1 ), and adapted to generate heat when it is electrically powered, so as to heat the water ( 4 ) contained in the tray ( 1 ), in particular to evaporate it; 
     a PTC cartridge ( 2 ) adapted to be electrically powered, arranged inside the tray ( 1 ) so as to be wetted by the water contained in the tray ( 1 ), adapted to operate as a sensor for the presence of water in the tray ( 1 ); 
     an electronic control unit ( 5 ) connected to the electric heater ( 3 ) and to the cartridge ( 2 ), configured to control, in particular to allow or prevent, the electric power supply of the electric heater ( 3 ); 
     wherein the electric heater ( 3 ) extenders lower than the PTC cartridge (2).

claims:
1 . A carry golf bag, comprising:
 a front, a back, a first side, and a second side;   a divider top comprising a leg connection bracket;   a base comprising a bottom panel and a receiving wall;   a flat comprising a crush zone extending across portions of the front, the first side, and the second side, adjacent the base;   a divider sleeve comprising a divider sleeve top, a divider sleeve bottom, and two or more reinforcement panels;   a stay comprising a stay top end, a stay bottom end, a top hinge, and a bottom hinge;   a stand assembly, the stand assembly comprising:
 a first leg comprising; a first upper end and a first lower end; 
 a second leg comprising a second upper end and a second lower end; 
 a first leg end cap configured to attach to the first upper end; 
 a second leg end cap configured to attach to the second upper end; 
 a spring; and 
 two spring brackets configured to couple the spring to the first and second legs at a point between the upper ends and the lower ends of the first and second legs; 
   wherein:
 the divider top and the base attach to opposite ends of the flat to form a hollow interior for receiving golf clubs; 
 the divider sleeve top attaches to the divider top and the divider sleeve bottom attaches to the base; 
 the reinforcement panels are positioned near the middle of the divider sleeve in a top to bottom direction; 
 the stay top end flexibly attaches to the divider top by way of the top hinge; 
 the stay bottom end flexibly attaches to the base by way of the bottom hinge; 
 the leg end caps of the stand assembly pivotably attach to the leg connection bracket of the divider top; 
 the spring of the stand assembly attaches to the base; 
 the golf bag can be placed in an upright position or a deployed position; 
 in the upright position, the legs of the stand assembly are retracted and flush with the flat; 
 in the deployed position, the stand assembly is deployed with the legs extended away from the flat. 



         2 . The carry golf bag of  claim 1 , wherein the divider sleeve bottom is attached to the base by looping or clipping into one or more base ribs. 


         3 . The carry golf bag of  claim 1 , wherein: the divider sleeve comprises a divider sleeve fabric and the divider sleeve bottom comprises bottom connection members that attach the divider sleeve bottom to the base; wherein the divider sleeve fabric does not extend all the way to the base. 


         4 . The carry golf bag of  claim 1 , wherein the divider sleeve comprises 2-8 reinforcement panels. 


         5 . The carry golf bag of  claim 4 , wherein the reinforcement panels are positioned on different sides of the divider sleeve and partially or fully surround the divider sleeve. 


         6 . The carry golf bag of  claim 5 , further comprising a first reinforcement panel and a second reinforcement panel;
 wherein:   each of the first reinforcement panel and the second reinforcement panel comprise a first vertical edge, a second vertical edge, a first horizontal edge, and a second horizontal edge;   the first vertical edge of the first reinforcement panel abuts the second vertical edge of the second reinforcement panel.   


         7 . The carry golf bag of  claim 1 , wherein the reinforcement panel is attached to the divider sleeve by sewing, adhesive, or clips. 


         8 . The carry golf bag of  claim 4 , wherein the reinforcement panels are each attached to the divider sleeve independently from one another. 


         9 . The carry golf bag of  claim 1 , wherein the reinforcement panel is not attached to the divider sleeve at corners of the divider sleeve. 


         10 . The carry golf bag of  claim 1 , wherein:
 the divider sleeve comprises a divider sleeve height;   the reinforcement panel comprises a reinforcement panel height;   
       the reinforcement panel height is 5%-10% of the divider sleeve height. 


         11 . The carry golf bag of  claim 6 , wherein the reinforcement panels comprise a total length measured continuously along the first horizontal edges of each abutting reinforcement panel, wherein the total length of the reinforcement panels is 50%-100% of a circumference of the divider sleeve to which the reinforcement panel is attached. 


         12 . The carry golf bag of  claim 7 , wherein the divider sleeve comprises a fabric tube, the fabric tube comprising an interior surface and an exterior surface; wherein the reinforcement panel is attached to the exterior surface of the fabric tube. 


         13 . The carry golf bag of  claim 7 , wherein the reinforcement panel is attached to an interior surface of the flat. 


         14 . The carry bag of  claim 13 , wherein the clips are located at each corner formed by the abutment of the first and second vertical edges of adjacent reinforcement panels. 


         15 . The carry golf bag of  claim 1 , wherein the base further comprises dividing ribs. 


         16 . The carry golf bag of  claim 15 , wherein the divider sleeve is coupled to a middle rib of the dividing ribs. 


         17 . The carry golf bag of  claim 1 , wherein the reinforcement panel is positioned about 45 cm above the base bottom panel. 


         18 . The carry golf bag of  claim 1 , wherein the reinforcement panel comprises a polyethylene board, fiberglass composite sheet, or carbon fiber composite sheet. 


         19 . The carry golf bag of  claim 6 , comprising four reinforcement panels, wherein the four reinforcement panels are attached to each side of the divider sleeve to form a pseudo-rectangular shape. 


         20 . The carry golf bag of  claim 19 , wherein the reinforcement panels lie smoothly across the divider sleeve surface.

