 select the BG from the plurality of BGs based on one or more of a number of code blocks per transport block (TB), a modulation and coding scheme (MCS), a modulation order, a number of layers for the scheduled LDPC coded transmission, a TB size, a first bandwidth of a component carrier (CC), or a second bandwidth of the scheduled LDPC coded transmission being above a threshold.   


         5 . The apparatus of  claim 1 , wherein the one or more processors are further configured to:
