and T diff  indicates the maximum time offset between said counting and timing devices;   at the monitoring start instant t a  sending wirelessly via said central processing and control unit a single multicast monitoring start message addressed to all the sensors;   receiving via said sensors the multicast monitoring start message;   initiating via the peripheral processing and control units of the sensors the sampling of the continuous time signal x m (t) at a sampling start time t 0 .   


