 each of the two first walls has a height more than that of each of the two second walls; 
 multiple grooves are formed in a top of each of the two first walls and a top of each of the two second walls; 
 each of the grooves is formed with two hooked locking pieces opposite to each other and spaced from each other; 
 each of the grooves is formed with two openings, with the two locking pieces located between the two openings; 
 each of the two first side panels has a first panel body having two extensions formed on two sides thereof; 
 the two extensions extend in the same direction and are perpendicular to the first panel body; 
 each of the two extensions is formed with multiple hooked locking blocks; 
 the first panel body has a bottom provided with multiple first pivot shafts; 
 each of the first pivot shafts is connected between two first shaft supports extending from the first panel body; 
 the two first side panels are mounted on the two first walls respectively, with each of the first pivot shafts locked between the two locking pieces, and with the two first shaft supports aligning with the two openings; 
