         9 . The adiabatic heat transfer system of  claim 6 , wherein one or more bleed conduit sensors in fluid communication with the bleed conduit are selected from a group consisting of a total dissolved solids (TDS) sensor, a conductivity sensor, a temperature sensor, a turbidity sensor, a pH sensor, a flow sensor, and combinations thereof. 


         10 . The adiabatic heat transfer system of  claim 7 , further comprising a control system designed to:
