 a) measuring, by a plurality of input devices ( 110 ), a plurality of inputs of the one or more users, each input of the plurality of inputs comprising measurements of one or more physiological parameters, measurements of one or more environmental parameters, and one or more user inputs comprising one or more user-proposed actions;   b) inputting the plurality of inputs into a decision Artificial Intelligence (AI) model ( 125 ) trained by existing decision-making data comprising relationships between properties and quality of decision-making, configured to accept the plurality of inputs from the plurality of input devices ( 110 ) and identify one or more decision-making impediments in the plurality of inputs;
