   c) inputting the one or more decision-making impediments into a database AI model ( 126 ) communicatively coupled to the decision AI model ( 125 ), trained by a database of known impediments to optimal decision making and thinking, configured to accept the one or more decision-making impediments from the decision AI model ( 125 ) and generate one or more decision-enhancing suggestions as output; and   d) returning the one or more decision-enhancing suggestions from the database AI model ( 126 ).   


