         6 ) The method of  claim 3 , wherein the plurality of inputs comprise speech analysis data, wherein the method further comprises inputting the speech analysis data into a Long Short-Term Memory Network (LSTM) configured to accept the speech analysis data as input and generate a quantified mental state as output, wherein the quantified mental state is inputted into the decision AI model ( 125 ). 


